-- The Contacts database layout (~/Library/Application Support/AddressBook/**/AddressBook-v22.abcddb) on macOS 26,
-- for tests that build a fixture address book. Made with `sqlite3 AddressBook-v22.abcddb .schema`, keeping the three
-- tables the bridge reads. Indexes, triggers and every other table are left out, and there are no rows.
